## 🔐 Authentication & Authorization

### User Roles
- **Donor**: Can list food, view requests, accept matches
- **Receiver**: Can create requests, browse food, accept matches
- **Admin**: Full system access including user management

### JWT Token Flow
1. User logs in via `/auth/login`
2. Backend returns JWT access token
3. Frontend stores token in localStorage
4. All subsequent API calls include token in `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header
5. Token expires after 30 minutes (configurable)

### Role Synchronization
- Frontend syncs roles from JWT token every 30 seconds
- Database role changes reflect after next login or sync interval
- Protected routes check roles before rendering components

## 🌐 API Endpoints

### Authentication
- `POST /auth/register` - Register new user
- `POST /auth/login` - User login
- `POST /auth/logout` - User logout
- `GET /auth/debug-token` - Validate token

### Food Management
- `GET /food/all` - List all available foods
- `POST /food` - Create food listing
- `GET /food/my/:userId` - Get user's food listings
- `PUT /food/:foodId` - Update food listing
- `DELETE /food/:foodId` - Delete food listing
- `GET /food/nearby` - Find nearby food items

### Requests
- `GET /requests/all` - List all requests
- `POST /requests` - Create food request
- `GET /requests/my/:userId` - Get user's requests
- `PUT /requests/:requestId` - Update request
- `DELETE /requests/:requestId` - Delete request
- `GET /food/requests/nearby` - Find nearby requests

### Transactions
- `POST /transactions` - Create transaction
- `GET /transactions/user/:userId` - User's transactions
- `PUT /transactions/:txnId/status` - Update status
- `POST /transactions/:txnId/complete` - Mark complete

### Admin Dashboard
- `GET /api/admin/dashboard/summary` - System metrics
- `GET /api/admin/users` - List all users (paginated)
- `GET /api/admin/users/:userId` - User details
- `PUT /api/admin/users/:userId/role` - Update user roles
- `DELETE /api/admin/users/:userId` - Deactivate user
- `GET /api/admin/foods` - List all foods (paginated)
- `DELETE /api/admin/foods/:foodId` - Delete food item
- `GET /api/admin/requests` - List all requests (paginated)
- `DELETE /api/admin/requests/:requestId` - Delete request
- `GET /api/admin/transactions` - List all transactions (paginated)
- `GET /api/admin/statistics/food-types` - Food type statistics
- `GET /api/admin/statistics/daily-activity` - Activity timeline
- `GET /api/admin/health` - System health check

### Analytics
- `GET /api/analytics/summary` - User-specific analytics
- `GET /api/analytics/global-summary` - Platform-wide stats

### MongoDB Features
- `GET /api/mongodb/notifications` - Get notifications
- `POST /api/mongodb/notifications/:id/read` - Mark as read
- `GET /logs/activities` - Activity feed
- `POST /feedback` - Submit feedback
- `GET /feedback` - Get feedback

### Route Optimization
- `POST /api/routes/optimize` - Calculate optimal route
- `GET /api/routes/:userId` - Get user's routes

## 🧪 Testing

### Using Postman
1. Import `FRNS_API_Postman_Collection.json`
2. Set environment variable `base_url` to `http://127.0.0.1:5000`
3. Login to get JWT token
4. Token auto-injects into protected requests

### Generate Test Token
```bash
python troubleshoot.py
```

### Test Scripts
```bash
# Route optimization
python test_route_optimization.py

# Notification flow
python test_notification_flow.py

# Socket.IO
